        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Totally recommend this shop!\n\nRobert and his team took great care of my car and kept me updated throughout the whole process. Excellent work and fair pricing. After taking chances trying to find a good garage each time, I’m sure this is the one.",
        "time": 1754665156,
