        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I do most of the work on my cars myself but when something complicated pops I go to the shop.A few weeks ago I discovered these guys and glad I did.very professional and affordable.if you have a Honda go there and you’ll be very satisfied with the quality service",
